  "releaseNotes": "WADO streaming support added for native and metadata.\nWADO handling single part requests correctly\nWADO validation checks for client request should respond with 4xx stauts code, server will return 500 if failure occurs.\nWADO Native octet-stream support at frame level added\nWADO Added RetrieveNativeStreamAsync to DicomWebClient to consume and serialize the async sequence incrementally for native multipart retrieval\nFrameSubSet fix to preserve the ordering of frames generation\nDicomWebSever.StreamResponse setting added to enable the experimental streaming responses",
